  "vibe": "Deep navy void (#0b0f2a) with mint (#6be0b8), coral (#ff6b4a) and violet (#8f7ae0); Righteous rounds the display while Chivo keeps the body sober. Twenty-six stars twinkle on independent sine phases and drift sideways; a mint ringed planet bobs at the right with its violet ring tilted −16° and two crater discs; a small violet moon sits low-left; and a cartoon rocket climbs the full frame height on a loop, rotated −14°, weaving on a slow sine, with a coral flame flickering under it at 9Hz. It carries the most aggressive camera of its family — roll 1.4, a 0.7 zoom punch, a spin in the set — over a deliberately unhurried world. Its mechanics are code diffs, terminal typing, telemetry rings and glowing numbers. For dev tools, launches, deploys and playful space-age product films.",
